# No version bump clears these. v28.5.2 is the last release on the
# github.com/docker/docker path and is still affected; the fixes ship only as
# Docker Engine 29.x, under github.com/moby/moby/v2.
#
# The module also arrives indirectly through sigs.k8s.io/cluster-api/test, so
# dropping it needs a Cluster API v1.12+ upgrade, which removes the v1beta1
# APIs this provider is built on.
#
# Trivy scopes an ignore to go.mod, never to the code importing it, so this is
# repo-wide. The docker-engine-modules depguard rule holds the line instead.
